.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RULE EDIT"
.SH NAME
hamstik rule edit \- Update an automation rule
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik rule edit [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update an automation rule
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I RULE_ID
Automation rule id
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --body-file
Read the JSON request body from this file; `-` reads stdin
.TP
.B --field
Structured JSON field as `key=value`; repeatable
.TP
.B --if-match
Current rule ETag
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Idempotency key override
